Description: EBI Security Guard
LongDescription: An EBI Security Guard tasked with patrolling urban zones and enforcing Eschaton’s policies in Edge Haven. As the corporate police force, they project authority while maintaining a visible presence to deter criminal activity. Equipped for both lethal and non-lethal engagement, their role is to maintain public order and corporate compliance.
